###################################################################################################
# LOOT RATES
#
# DropChance is the top/global drop chance multiplier for the Drops category. It applies to every
# item drop chance that passes through the loot roll hook, then the more specific drop rate can
# apply on top. Example: drop.chance x2 and drop.mount x3 makes mount drops that match the mount
# filter act as x6.
